<blockquote>
<p>rumetzen: GnaMobile, you'll be glad you did [read Endless Hunt series]</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Damn sure I am. It's practically an understatement to say that this is by far one of the best series I've read up to date on this site, even competing with some published stories I've read. Very well done, anxiously waiting for the next one. As great as it is though, it still has a few minor errors. (one of which is too story changing for me to edit myself as I did in the previous ones)</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
