<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>I've also provided pictures of the paragraphs the mistakes are in just so you can skim the first sentences of each paragraph to find it instead of rereading the entire thing looking for them: <a href="http://m.imgur.com/a/pFP6r" target="_blank">Mistake 1 is at the bottom, mistake 7 at the top of the page.</a><br />
1.</p>
